  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to sustainable use and management of sugar crop residues for sustainable production and natural resources conservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To apply a circular agricultural modality by effectively and efficiently returning the processed sugar production waste and residue as organic matters into the sugar crop field, which will not only address the negative environmental impacts of direct waste disposal but also reduce the application of chemical fertilizers whilst increasing the land fertility.</narrative>
  </description>
